[{"client_msg_id":"3d15edf1-aac8-40c1-b007-5d781689cff4","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"64bit な戻り値は 32bit Windows だとうまく取り扱えないですよね?","ts":"1631716645.154700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5lpGp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9d2304fe-d189-4b88-8016-7c911bd1cd57","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"Windows の syscall で DLL 関数呼ぶやり方だと","ts":"1631716631.154400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yTH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8c4c064a-f70a-44ae-b952-837d37a92d4d","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"C++ な const は静的検査ですよね","ts":"1631691908.154000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"f3i"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9d240db2-bd43-474c-b34b-146781fb2ed7","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"C++ な const 欲しい人もいるんでしょうね。","ts":"1631691824.153700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1qGC/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c0d2682c-6ce9-44a5-949a-2425e90d5fdd","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"静的検査ではないのか…","ts":"1631691772.153100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gwkH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"17bbc0b6-0c99-4b11-a0ae-869ddcb81603","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"`runtime.Freeze` の実装が、内部で実際に触ってみる(race で引っかかる様に)って実装になってて面白い。","ts":"1631691502.152900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IP2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"46ff57a0-4869-470a-817c-0f33ec7f8b61","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"race detector を使って freeze をやる試み。若干ジョーク臭い？w","ts":"1631691472.152200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Bwx/v"}]},{"client_msg_id":"20cf0167-bf52-4bb7-9af6-5e0f6efe417a","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/tailscale/go/pull/19\u003e","ts":"1631691440.151300","attachments":[{"color":"36a64f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/tailscale/go/pull/19|#19 all: add immutability instrumentation [WIP]\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/tailscale/go/pull/19|#19 all: add immutability instrumentation [WIP]\u003e","text":"Quick hack using the runtime.\n\nTo use, given a value x that you want to be immutable,  \ncall `reflect.Freeze(\u0026amp;x)`.\n\nThen run your program with `-race -gcflags=all=-racenoreads`.\n\nWrites to `x` will cause a race detector panic.  \nReads from `x` can proceed as normal.\n\nSample program:\n\n```\npackage main\n\nimport (\n\t\"fmt\"\n\t\"reflect\"\n)\n\nfunc main() {\n\tvar x [2][2]string\n\treflect.Freeze(\u0026amp;x)\n\tfmt.Println(x)\n\tx[0][0] = \"a\"\n}\n```","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/tailscale/go|tailscale/go\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1629403512}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xd4"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"\u003c@U01AQ5BFNLX\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1631681421.151100","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null}]
